    {
      "title": "Comparisons and alternatives",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "JSBC Labs recommends recording the target Flow API name, expected version, activation method, owner and verification window in a release manifest. This is operational advice for making the activated alert logic traceable, rather than a Salesforce-enforced manifest format. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://jsbclabs.com/blog/activating-flow-version-is-not-release-management",
