    {
      "title": "Facts and statements",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Proposed activation test policy: exercise both an interview already running and a scheduled path still pending across a version switch. Verify the intended version independently for each lifecycle; a successful test of one does not establish the behavior of the other. (high confidence)",
